<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gadzooks downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gadzooks downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Smith Barney analyst Stephen Kim confirmed that he downgraded Gadzooks Inc to neutral from a buy rating.</p>
<p>--further details were not provided.</p>
